{"title":"GODS","artist":"New Jeans","sourceId":"reference:72wVzKahoDB2w7ZnVhd8","sourceHash":"5a09eb595f8cc19453ba25be89016dc8e8d541d68a5582bc381a6df20518cdb5","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":37516231,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.76,"end":7.27,"text":"Go-go-go-go-go-gods","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":7.27,"end":13.69,"text":"Go-go-go-go-go-gods","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":13.69,"end":17.38,"text":"Ay, this is what you came for, blood on the game ball","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":17.38,"end":20.12,"text":"Everybody dropping like rainfall","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":20.12,"end":24.32,"text":"Uh, this is your moment, eyes on the pulpit, kid","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":24.32,"end":26.68,"text":"Think church just opened","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":26.68,"end":30.38,"text":"And they're singing your praises, la-la-la","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":30.38,"end":33.7,"text":"Screaming your name out lo-lo-loud","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":33.7,"end":38.7,"text":"One more step, you're immortal now, 'cause","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":38.7,"end":42.06,"text":"Once you play God, once you play God","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":42.06,"end":45.13,"text":"They're gonna crumble one by one","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":45.13,"end":48.16,"text":"Then we gon' ride right into the sun","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":48.16,"end":51.82,"text":"Like it's the day my kingdom come","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":51.82,"end":58.55,"text":"Baby, we're go-go-go-go-go-gods","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start"